# Vercel ignore patterns — exclude heavy dirs, keep what functions & dashboard need

# Build/planning docs
planning/
*.md
!llms.txt
!agents.md
# Runtime API functions read generated Markdown outbox artifacts.
!outbox/*.md
!outbox/**/*.md

# Test suite
tests/

# Hobby-plan function budget: 12 Serverless Functions per deployment.
#
# regional-news and market-watch used to be excluded here to stay under it. That
# kept the count legal but made /api/tools.json lie: the manifest advertises
# regional_news.list at /api/regional-news, and agents following it got a 404.
# api/artifact.py now serves reasoning, track-record, calibration and map-data
# from one function instead of four, which buys the room to deploy them for real.
#
# api/source-health.py does not exist; the entry is kept out rather than carried
# forward. Count with: ls api/*.py | wc -l  (tests/test_vercel_functions.py
# enforces the budget).

# Data. Kept: history/ (theater replay), regional_news/ minus raw/,
# coordination/, intervention_state.json and market_watch/, which the build
# and the Regional Connections page read. Everything else is listed rather
# than excluded with `data/*` plus `!` re-includes: the CLI's local matcher
# does not honour re-includes under an excluded parent, so `vercel deploy`
# uploads shipped no data/ at all and the build failed on the news copy.
data/approvals/
data/calibration/
data/editorial/
data/feedback/
data/ndbc/
data/procurement/
data/registries/
data/validation_packs/
data/webhooks/
data/regional_news/raw/

# Pipeline source code — packagers + mcp_adapter are imported by runtime API
# functions (/api/status imports packagers.source_health; /api/mcp imports
# mcp_adapter.http), so they must ship even though they are not standalone Vercel
# functions. cli/ and watchers/ stay excluded as local-only tooling.
cli/
mergers/
watchers/
distributors/
.flue/

# Config & infra (not needed at runtime)
.github/
deploy/
vercel.json
.gitignore
requirements.txt
run_pipeline.sh
server.py

# Credentials & local state
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pipeline/
.sent_*.json

# Wizard-created domains (ephemeral)
domains/user-*.json

# Agent verification outputs
output/